    "title": "Los Angeles General Medical Center Soars with Enhanced Patient Care and Nurse Wellness - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juliette Kessler ,\n8 hours ago Los Angeles General Medical Center is on the up. The LA-based hospital is charting a course towards improved patient care and nurse well-being, boasting significant strides in nurse retention and patient outcomes after boldly revamping their work culture. The place where staff were once run ragged, they're now hitting their stride with notable achievements under their belt, all thanks to a transformative initiative grounded in the American Association of Critical-Care Nurses (AACN) Healthy Work Environment Standards. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
